        <link:link rdf:resource="#item_1788"/>
        <dc:title>Genome analysis of the proteorhodopsin-containing marine bacterium &lt;i&gt;Polaribacter&lt;/i&gt; sp. MED152 (Flavobacteria)</dc:title>
        <dcterms:abstract>MED152 has a large range of genes that allow it to mediate, and possibly optimize, its reaction/response to light, a major environmental variable in the surface waters from which it was isolated.</dcterms:abstract>
