        <link:link rdf:resource="#item_2195"/>
        <dc:title>GTDB-Tk: a toolkit to classify genomes with the Genome Taxonomy Database</dc:title>
        <dcterms:abstract>Summary: The Genome Taxonomy Database Toolkit (GTDB-Tk) provides objective taxonomic assignments for bacterial and archaeal genomes based on the GTDB. GTDB-Tk is computationally efﬁcient and able to classify thousands of draft genomes in parallel. Here we demonstrate the accuracy of the GTDB-Tk taxonomic assignments by evaluating its performance on a phylogenetically diverse set of 10 156 bacterial and archaeal metagenomeassembled genomes.</dcterms:abstract>
        <dc:date>2020-03-01</dc:date>
        <z:language>en</z:language>
        <z:shortTitle>GTDB-Tk</z:shortTitle>
        <z:libraryCatalog>DOI.org (Crossref)</z:libraryCatalog>
        <dc:identifier>
            <dcterms:URI>
                <rdf:value>https://academic.oup.com/bioinformatics/article/36/6/1925/5626182</rdf:value>
            </dcterms:URI>
        </dc:identifier>
        <dcterms:dateSubmitted>2025-10-17 12:43:10</dcterms:dateSubmitted>
        <dc:rights>http://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/</dc:rights>
        <bib:pages>1925-1927</bib:pages>
    </bib:Article>
